<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<loadFolders>
  <v1.6>
    <li>/</li>
    <!-- With a LoadFolders.xml only the folders listed here load. Art sits under the mod
         root, so "/" covers it; there is no Common/ root. -->
    <li>1.6</li>
    <!-- Optional-mod/DLC compat roots, gated by package id via IfModActive: DefInjected
         entries and textures cannot carry MayRequire, so the load root is the gate.
         Mods/<Mod Name>/ holds version-independent content (art), 1.6/Mods/<Mod Name>/ the
         Defs, Patches and the DefInjected that must share their root. The game only scans
         well-known folders (Defs/, Languages/, Textures/, ...) directly under a load root,
         so "/" and 1.6 never see Mods/.

         Biotech gate, for the tox gas ability: the gas grid refuses ToxGas without Biotech
         and the exposure hediff does not exist, so the ability def, its DefInjected and its
         gizmo art must all live behind this gate. Uncomment when the first one lands:
    <li IfModActive="ludeon.rimworld.biotech">Mods/Biotech</li>
    <li IfModActive="ludeon.rimworld.biotech">1.6/Mods/Biotech</li>
    -->
  </v1.6>
</loadFolders>
